      "raw": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just today, friends and neighbors, I launched my second Kickstarter for&nbsp;<em>Cold Steel Wardens: Roleplaying in the Iron Age of Comics</em>. &nbsp;This one, following the successful Kickstart of our corebook, is for&nbsp;<em>Cold Steel Wardens: Rogues Gallery. &nbsp;</em>It&#39;s a bevy of mooks, made men, metahumans, maniacs, and masterminds, ready to drop into any Iron Age superhero game. &nbsp;</p><p><em>CSW: Rogues Gallery</em> builds heavily on the world set down in the&nbsp;<em>CSW</em> corebook, providing detailed writeups on Stonegate Federal Penitentiary and Lincroft Asylum, as well as how to use prison and asylum settings in such a game. &nbsp;The majority of the book, however, is written from the perspective of the phase-shifting vigilante, Sawbones, whose notes include in-character evidence pieces, including police reports, psychological evaluations, interviews, and more. &nbsp;</p><p>Don&#39;t have&nbsp;<em>Cold Steel Wardens&nbsp;</em>yet? &nbsp;Pick up the corebook as part of our Kickstarter drive!</p><p>If Rook City is your favorite Sentinels expansion....if you can&#39;t wait for Daredevil Season 2...then&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/apklosky/csw-rogues-gallery-iron-age-superhero-rpg-suppleme\"><em>CSW: Rogues Gallery</em> is waiting for you!</a></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Thanks again for your support!</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
