      "created_at": "2016-08-12T22:14:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The thought has crossed my mind, but I'm loathe to co-op an IP, especially as myself.</p><p>You'll note that I personally, never run any of Jules'&nbsp;<em>Birds of Prey/CSW</em> crossover games. &nbsp;I have no issues with other people doing it, but it's not something I want to do personally.</p><p>That said, yes--a good number of the Sentinels characters would easily fit into&nbsp;<em>CSW</em>. &nbsp;Tachyon wouldn't be hard to make, or Haka, Fanatic, or Ra for that matter.</p>",
